## Problem

Melo Portal is a membership app that allows users to engage in the community. They can get tokens, bit events to connect with like-minded peers and CEOs.

- How to gamify and engage users when an event starts bidding?
- How to make users feels prestige by owning the membership?

Therefore, I have spent time on crafting the two core experiecence

- Bidding Experience
- Membership card and Token

![](/images/experience/project-melo/image.webp)

![](/images/experience/project-melo/image-1.webp)

## Bidding Experience

I have iterate over many versions. Numpad, Counter, Pure Input, you named it and finally settles to Slide to Bid. It reduces user cognitive load and have a unique advantage to 

- show the proportion of all token remaining
- Easily visualize the minimum bid
- Minimal input required

![](/images/experience/project-melo/image-2.webp)

## Melo Members Card

There is a trend for vertical card. Therefore I have perform iterations on the card design and invite some members to give feedback on it. The dark blue and orange encapsulates the core Melo brand design language and provide a premium identity to members. 

